     fhir:div [ fhir:v "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet use-context</b></p><a name=\"use-context\"> </a><a name=\"hcuse-context\"> </a><p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p><ul><li>Import all the codes that are contained in <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.3.0/ValueSet-v2-0265.html\">hl7VS-specialtyType</a></li><li>Include codes from<a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\"><code>http://snomed.info/sct</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a 394733009 (Medical specialties)</li><li>Include all codes defined in <a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r5\"><code>urn:iso:std:iso:3166</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span></li><li>Include codes from<code>http://unstats.un.org/unsd/methods/m49/m49.htm</code><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where class  = region</li><li>Include codes from<a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\"><code>http://snomed.info/sct</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a 387961004 (Kingdom Animalia (organism))</li><li>Import all the codes that are contained in <a href=\"valueset-administrative-gender.html\">AdministrativeGender</a></li><li>Import all the codes that are contained in <a href=\"valueset-condition-code.html\">Condition/Problem/Diagnosis Codes</a></li><li>Include all codes defined in <a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r5\"><code>http://nucc.org/provider-taxonomy</code></a><span style=\"opacity: 0.5\" title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. When building this specification, the most recent version 22.1 has been used\"> version ⏿22.1</span></li><li>Import all the codes that are contained in <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.3.0/ValueSet-v3-ActEncounterCode.html\">ActEncounterCode</a></li><li>Import all the codes that are contained in <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.3.0/ValueSet-v3-ActTaskCode.html\">ActTaskCode</a></li><li>Import all the codes that are contained in <a href=\"valueset-usage-context-agreement-scope.html\">Usage Context Agreement Scope</a></li></ul></div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral ]
